.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Export merged Birda detections as BirdNET-Pi SQL, SQLite, and optional MP3s\&. 

Takes an output directory and maximum record count (zero means all)\&. Reads birda_merged_15s_dedup\&.csv from the working directory\&. Prompts for MP3 generation and replacement; birds\&.sql and birds\&.db are always rebuilt\&. The database schema follows the BirdNET-Pi detections table\&. When audio is requested, each imported observation gets a 15-second clip beginning at its exact Start (s) offset; short tails are padded with silence\&. Source WAV paths in the CSV are resolved relative to the CSV directory\&. 
.PP
\fBCommand line\fP
.RS 4

.PP
.nf
python3 birda_csv_to_birdnet\&.py OUTPUT_DIRECTORY MAX_RECORDS

.fi
.PP
 
.RE
.PP
\fBOutput tree\fP
.RS 4
The output contains BirdNET-Pi/scripts/birds\&.db, birds\&.sql, and BirdSongs/Extracted/By_Date/YYYY-MM-DD/Common_Name/*\&.mp3 when audio is generated\&. The companion staging script can turn these into an unambiguous BirdNET-Go import directory\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
\fBbirda_process_csv\&.py\fP 
.PP
\fBprepare_birdnet_go_import\&.py\fP 
.PP
test_birda_csv_to_birdnet\&.py 
.RE
.PP

